{"bvid": "BV1j1rGBvEYv", "title": "“影子跟读法”毁了中国人的口语", "duration": 253, "subs": [{"cid": 35296447651, "lan": "ai-zh", "n": 226, "body": [{"from": 0.1, "to": 3.12, "sid": 1, "location": 2, "content": "就是那个影子跟读法正在毁了中国人的口语啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 3.12, "to": 3.94, "sid": 2, "location": 2, "content": "我不知道大家是不是", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 3.94, "to": 5.98, "sid": 3, "location": 2, "content": "每次刷到那种博主教你学英语的视频啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 5.98, "to": 8.98, "sid": 4, "location": 2, "content": "就是影子跟读法一般都是一个露脸的博主", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 8.98, "to": 10.22, "sid": 5, "location": 2, "content": "先秀一段自己的口音", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 10.22, "to": 11.62, "sid": 6, "location": 2, "content": "然后让你感觉到他很厉害", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 11.62, "to": 11.9, "sid": 7, "location": 2, "content": "他很牛", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 11.9, "to": 12.66, "sid": 8, "location": 2, "content": "你想你想他怎么学", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 12.66, "to": 13.46, "sid": 9, "location": 2, "content": "然后开始给你介绍说啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 13.46, "to": 14.84, "sid": 10, "location": 2, "content": "我使用的是影子跟读法", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 14.84, "to": 16.04, "sid": 11, "location": 2, "content": "他就整个视频都是全英文的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 16.04, "to": 16.56, "sid": 12, "location": 2, "content": "配上中文字幕", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 16.56, "to": 17.08, "sid": 13, "location": 2, "content": "然后跟你说", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 17.08, "to": 18.16, "sid": 14, "location": 2, "content": "首先要找一个适合你的材料", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 18.16, "to": 19.22, "sid": 15, "location": 2, "content": "然后一句一句的跟读", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 19.22, "to": 19.92, "sid": 16, "location": 2, "content": "什么注意什么", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 19.92, "to": 21.86, "sid": 17, "location": 2, "content": "情绪停顿发音这么练", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 21.86, "to": 23.1, "sid": 18, "location": 2, "content": "然后重复多了就有效", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 23.1, "to": 23.76, "sid": 19, "location": 2, "content": "哎呀我跟你说", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 23.76, "to": 25.24, "sid": 20, "location": 2, "content": "这个真的是坑害了很多人啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 25.24, "to": 26.28, "sid": 21, "location": 2, "content": "我首先说一点", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 26.28, "to": 27.68, "sid": 22, "location": 2, "content": "不是你口语好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 27.68, "to": 28.68, "sid": 23, "location": 2, "content": "这个方法就好用", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 28.68, "to": 29.4, "sid": 24, "location": 2, "content": "就适用于大多数人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 29.4, "to": 30.58, "sid": 25, "location": 2, "content": "我不知道大家能不能理解这个道理", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 30.58, "to": 31.28, "sid": 26, "location": 2, "content": "就像不是一个人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 31.28, "to": 31.76, "sid": 27, "location": 2, "content": "他是学霸", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 31.76, "to": 32.96, "sid": 28, "location": 2, "content": "他的方法就一定适用于所有人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 32.96, "to": 33.64, "sid": 29, "location": 2, "content": "因为大多数人是普通人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 33.64, "to": 34.46, "sid": 30, "location": 2, "content": "每个人基础不一样", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 34.46, "to": 35.93, "sid": 31, "location": 2, "content": "那些口语好的人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 35.93, "to": 37.65, "sid": 32, "location": 2, "content": "你不能因为你口语好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 37.65, "to": 38.73, "sid": 33, "location": 2, "content": "且你用了影子跟读法", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 38.73, "to": 40.91, "sid": 34, "location": 2, "content": "所以你就证明了影子跟读法对口语提升有帮助", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 40.91, "to": 42.55, "sid": 35, "location": 2, "content": "因为你有可能本身语感就不错", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 42.55, "to": 43.23, "sid": 36, "location": 2, "content": "英语天赋也不错", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 43.23, "to": 44.07, "sid": 37, "location": 2, "content": "记忆力也很好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 44.07, "to": 45.59, "sid": 38, "location": 2, "content": "这个时候你用影子跟读法是没问题的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 45.59, "to": 46.23, "sid": 39, "location": 2, "content": "这个就像什么呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 46.23, "to": 48.02, "sid": 40, "location": 2, "content": "就像那个咱们讲这个记忆", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 48.02, "to": 49.98, "sid": 41, "location": 2, "content": "好多人之前就是受这个艾宾浩斯对记忆法", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 49.98, "to": 50.42, "sid": 42, "location": 2, "content": "的影响吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 50.42, "to": 51.98, "sid": 43, "location": 2, "content": "我之前没提出来这个葫芦背书法之前", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 51.98, "to": 53.7, "sid": 44, "location": 2, "content": "很多人他觉得这个背书只能艾宾浩斯么背", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 53.7, "to": 55.34, "sid": 45, "location": 2, "content": "然后一按一按艾宾浩斯这么背十几本书", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 55.34, "to": 56.4, "sid": 46, "location": 2, "content": "背完就越背越痛苦", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 56.4, "to": 57.06, "sid": 47, "location": 2, "content": "同样我跟你说", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 57.06, "to": 58.3, "sid": 48, "location": 2, "content": "为什么影子跟读法是有问题的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 58.3, "to": 59.82, "sid": 49, "location": 2, "content": "因为他强调的重点就是错的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 59.82, "to": 62.03, "sid": 50, "location": 2, "content": "因为他让你去找一个适合你的材料", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 62.03, "to": 63.11, "sid": 51, "location": 2, "content": "去模仿那个", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 63.11, "to": 65.04, "sid": 52, "location": 2, "content": "比如说美剧还模仿那个角色的语气", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 65.04, "to": 65.7, "sid": 53, "location": 2, "content": "什么神态", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 65.7, "to": 66.64, "sid": 54, "location": 2, "content": "把他想象成你跟他一样", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 66.64, "to": 67.72, "sid": 55, "location": 2, "content": "什么停顿情绪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 67.72, "to": 68.96, "sid": 56, "location": 2, "content": "你模仿那个有鸡毛用啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 68.96, "to": 70.08, "sid": 57, "location": 2, "content": "我就想问那口语", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 70.08, "to": 71.48, "sid": 58, "location": 2, "content": "首先重要的是流畅度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 71.48, "to": 72.52, "sid": 59, "location": 2, "content": "第二重要的是准确性", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 72.52, "to": 73.2, "sid": 60, "location": 2, "content": "什么叫流畅度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 73.2, "to": 74.48, "sid": 61, "location": 2, "content": "就是你表达内容很流畅", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 74.48, "to": 75.0, "sid": 62, "location": 2, "content": "中间别卡", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 75.0, "to": 75.64, "sid": 63, "location": 2, "content": "中间别老停顿", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 75.64, "to": 77.2, "sid": 64, "location": 2, "content": "比如说呃你别老这个嗯", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 77.2, "to": 78.0, "sid": 65, "location": 2, "content": "然后或者有那种口癖说", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 78.0, "to": 78.44, "sid": 66, "location": 2, "content": "I mean i mean", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 78.44, "to": 79.02, "sid": 67, "location": 2, "content": "You know you know", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 79.02, "to": 79.8, "sid": 68, "location": 2, "content": "如果你听一个人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 79.8, "to": 80.32, "sid": 69, "location": 2, "content": "他说了很多这个", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 80.32, "to": 80.52, "sid": 70, "location": 2, "content": "I mean", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 80.52, "to": 80.68, "sid": 71, "location": 2, "content": "I mean", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 80.68, "to": 81.36, "sid": 72, "location": 2, "content": "you know you know啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 81.36, "to": 83.51, "sid": 73, "location": 2, "content": "或者呃呃这就表明你的口语直接拉完了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 83.51, "to": 83.87, "sid": 74, "location": 2, "content": "知道吗", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 83.87, "to": 85.55, "sid": 75, "location": 2, "content": "第二个口语中的是准确度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 85.55, "to": 86.79, "sid": 76, "location": 2, "content": "就是你用词的准确性", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 86.79, "to": 89.23, "sid": 77, "location": 2, "content": "你过分强调那个影子跟读去学人家什么情绪", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 89.23, "to": 89.67, "sid": 78, "location": 2, "content": "语音语调", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 89.67, "to": 91.03, "sid": 79, "location": 2, "content": "我真不明白那个有啥用", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 91.03, "to": 93.35, "sid": 80, "location": 2, "content": "就是那个语调是属于你精益求精了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 93.35, "to": 94.79, "sid": 81, "location": 2, "content": "已经就是表达也很精准了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 94.79, "to": 95.91, "sid": 82, "location": 2, "content": "然后流畅也很流畅了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 95.91, "to": 96.51, "sid": 83, "location": 2, "content": "最后你闲着无聊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 96.51, "to": 97.19, "sid": 84, "location": 2, "content": "你再想提高下口语", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 97.19, "to": 98.62, "sid": 85, "location": 2, "content": "你去练练语音语调没毛病", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 98.62, "to": 100.32, "sid": 86, "location": 2, "content": "但大多数人缺的是那个语音语调吗", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 100.32, "to": 103.0, "sid": 87, "location": 2, "content": "大多数人是无法连续说五句完整的英文句子", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 103.0, "to": 103.88, "sid": 88, "location": 2, "content": "然后一旦说了五句以上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 103.88, "to": 104.92, "sid": 89, "location": 2, "content": "就开始hei she部分", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 104.92, "to": 106.72, "sid": 90, "location": 2, "content": "然后单数第三人称也忘了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 106.72, "to": 108.02, "sid": 91, "location": 2, "content": "然后说话也没有时态", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 108.02, "to": 108.46, "sid": 92, "location": 2, "content": "全是一般", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 108.46, "to": 110.22, "sid": 93, "location": 2, "content": "现在时也就没有一般现在时有任何时态", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 110.22, "to": 111.02, "sid": 94, "location": 2, "content": "这才是大多数人的问题", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 111.02, "to": 112.72, "sid": 95, "location": 2, "content": "所以你让那个影子跟读就没有任何用", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 112.72, "to": 114.2, "sid": 96, "location": 2, "content": "就像我上个视频给大家已经示范了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 114.2, "to": 115.4, "sid": 97, "location": 2, "content": "我给大家用这个怪奇物语", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 115.4, "to": 116.4, "sid": 98, "location": 2, "content": "第五季第一集给你示范了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 116.4, "to": 116.98, "sid": 99, "location": 2, "content": "怎么练口语", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 116.98, "to": 117.74, "sid": 100, "location": 2, "content": "你跟读跟读", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 117.74, "to": 118.46, "sid": 101, "location": 2, "content": "你跟读1万遍", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 118.46, "to": 119.58, "sid": 102, "location": 2, "content": "你好记性不如烂笔头啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 119.58, "to": 120.66, "sid": 103, "location": 2, "content": "那口语中的是八句型", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 120.66, "to": 121.16, "sid": 104, "location": 2, "content": "八句型", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 121.16, "to": 121.82, "sid": 105, "location": 2, "content": "你积累下来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 121.82, "to": 122.38, "sid": 106, "location": 2, "content": "你打印到纸上", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 122.38, "to": 123.26, "sid": 107, "location": 2, "content": "或者你拿个小本子抄", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 123.26, "to": 123.94, "sid": 108, "location": 2, "content": "把剧情扒下来", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 123.94, "to": 125.78, "sid": 109, "location": 2, "content": "然后每天自己对着个墙多读一读", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 125.78, "to": 127.06, "sid": 110, "location": 2, "content": "你这口音烂点都无所谓", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 127.06, "to": 127.5, "sid": 111, "location": 2, "content": "我跟你说", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 127.5, "to": 128.5, "sid": 112, "location": 2, "content": "影子跟不能火就说明啥呢", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 128.5, "to": 130.02, "sid": 113, "location": 2, "content": "就是说明大家还没有对这个口音曲美", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 130.02, "to": 131.06, "sid": 114, "location": 2, "content": "还有那些口音警察", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 131.06, "to": 131.9, "sid": 115, "location": 2, "content": "我在这里真发个口音", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 131.9, "to": 132.98, "sid": 116, "location": 2, "content": "警察给我 yourself", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 132.98, "to": 134.82, "sid": 117, "location": 2, "content": "你们老在那嘲笑别人口音口音什么", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 134.82, "to": 135.64, "sid": 118, "location": 2, "content": "你说话有口音", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 135.64, "to": 137.56, "sid": 119, "location": 2, "content": "不是不知道你护照是蓝本了还是咋了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 137.56, "to": 138.08, "sid": 120, "location": 2, "content": "那我有口音", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 138.08, "to": 138.52, "sid": 121, "location": 2, "content": "我是中国人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 138.52, "to": 139.08, "sid": 122, "location": 2, "content": "不是很正常吗", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 139.08, "to": 139.88, "sid": 123, "location": 2, "content": "那美国50个州", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 139.88, "to": 140.72, "sid": 124, "location": 2, "content": "加州有加州的口音", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 140.72, "to": 141.12, "sid": 125, "location": 2, "content": "伊利诺伊州", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 141.12, "to": 141.76, "sid": 126, "location": 2, "content": "伊利诺伊州的口音", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 141.76, "to": 142.7, "sid": 127, "location": 2, "content": "纽约州有纽约州的口音", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 142.7, "to": 143.1, "sid": 128, "location": 2, "content": "怎么了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 143.1, "to": 144.26, "sid": 129, "location": 2, "content": "就是你这美国也没来过", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 144.26, "to": 146.34, "sid": 130, "location": 2, "content": "护照后面白本天天搁那互联网上评判不说哇", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 146.34, "to": 147.04, "sid": 131, "location": 2, "content": "你说话有口音", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 147.04, "to": 148.02, "sid": 132, "location": 2, "content": "你这是拉完了啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 148.02, "to": 149.42, "sid": 133, "location": 2, "content": "口语夯爆就看两件事", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 149.42, "to": 150.02, "sid": 134, "location": 2, "content": "一看流畅度", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 150.02, "to": 150.7, "sid": 135, "location": 2, "content": "二看准确性", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 150.7, "to": 151.82, "sid": 136, "location": 2, "content": "你过分强调口音", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 151.82, "to": 152.44, "sid": 137, "location": 2, "content": "就是拉完了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 152.44, "to": 153.5, "sid": 138, "location": 2, "content": "我现在就比如说有两个人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 153.5, "to": 154.5, "sid": 139, "location": 2, "content": "一个人他说的很流畅", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 154.5, "to": 155.34, "sid": 140, "location": 2, "content": "然后用词也很精准", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 155.34, "to": 158.24, "sid": 141, "location": 2, "content": "但是呃他口音很一般对吧", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 158.24, "to": 160.18, "sid": 142, "location": 2, "content": "然后另一个人是他说的也不流畅", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 160.18, "to": 160.78, "sid": 143, "location": 2, "content": "全是这种口癖", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 160.78, "to": 161.34, "sid": 144, "location": 2, "content": "就是you know you know", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 161.34, "to": 161.5, "sid": 145, "location": 2, "content": "I mean", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 161.5, "to": 161.7, "sid": 146, "location": 2, "content": "I mean", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 161.7, "to": 162.5, "sid": 147, "location": 2, "content": "然后中间有很多呃", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 162.5, "to": 164.02, "sid": 148, "location": 2, "content": "呃但是他说的语音语调很像美国人", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 164.02, "to": 164.8, "sid": 149, "location": 2, "content": "你觉得哪个人口语好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 164.8, "to": 165.9, "sid": 150, "location": 2, "content": "肯定是前者好不好", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 165.9, "to": 167.68, "sid": 151, "location": 2, "content": "你现在就必须得这种口语好的人去魅", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 167.68, "to": 168.82, "sid": 152, "location": 2, "content": "你不要刷到一个博主", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 168.82, "to": 169.08, "sid": 153, "location": 2, "content": "哎呀", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 169.08, "to": 170.08, "sid": 154, "location": 2, "content": "他这个口音好说哇", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 170.08, "to": 170.84, "sid": 155, "location": 2, "content": "博主你是怎么练的", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 170.84, "to": 172.42, "sid": 156, "location": 2, "content": "这完全是误导人啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 172.42, "to": 173.58, "sid": 157, "location": 2, "content": "人家还没学会走路", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 173.58, "to": 174.34, "sid": 158, "location": 2, "content": "你教别人跑步", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 174.34, "to": 175.54, "sid": 159, "location": 2, "content": "然后你给别人展示你的口音", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 175.54, "to": 176.42, "sid": 160, "location": 2, "content": "然后跟别人说影子跟读", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 176.42, "to": 177.82, "sid": 161, "location": 2, "content": "你这不纯扯淡吗", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 177.82, "to": 179.46, "sid": 162, "location": 2, "content": "我觉得学英语口语是要有一个顺序的啊", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 179.46, "to": 180.88, "sid": 163, "location": 2, "content": "就是先练准确度和流畅性", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 180.88, "to": 182.38, "sid": 164, "location": 2, "content": "你有流畅度和准确性之后", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 182.38, "to": 183.84, "sid": 165, "location": 2, "content": "你再你就已经很强了", "music": 0.0}, {"from": 183.84, "to": 184.68, "sid": 166, "location": 2, "content": "就是你的英语口语水平", "music": 0.0}, 